3136  *==============================================================================
3137  *==============================================================================
3138  * Variables (Grouped for Readability)
3139  *==============================================================================
3140  VARIABLES
3141  * --- [1] Volume Variables (Real Quantities) ---
3142   C(i,z,time)             Consumption of commodity i by households in region z
3143   CABX(z,time)            Current account balance of region z in terms of the international currency
3144   CG(i,z,time)            Public consumption of commodity i in region z
3145   CI(j,z,time)            Total intermediate consumption of industry j in region z
3146   CE(j,z,time)            Total intermediate consumption of industry j in region z
3147   CMIN(i,z,time)          Minimum consumption of commodity i by households in region z
3148   CTH_REAL(z,time)        Real household consumption in region z
3149   DD(i,z,time)            Domestic demand for commodity i produced locally in region z
3150   DI(i,j,z,time)          Intermediate consumption of commodity i by industry j in region z
